flowchart TD
  K{{"`**Plain lowercase keystroke?**`"}}
  W{{"`**Which slot ends here?**`"}}
  CLOSE["`**Whole-item close**<br/>x… item, or chain lead`"]
  PAST["`**Past close part**<br/>after the second =`"]
  LINK["`**Link close suffix**<br/>=x… with lowercase x`"]
  V{{"`**Close lexer accepts?**`"}}
  ALIAS["`**Swap the one byte**<br/>x types !, s types *`"]
